journal/journal-v2/src/main/scala/com/github/j5ik2o/pekko/persistence/dynamodb/journal/head/JournalHeadMigration.scala  # JournalHead migration tool that scans and writes the tables through the v2 DynamoDbClient.
journal/journal-v2/src/main/scala/com/github/j5ik2o/pekko/persistence/dynamodb/journal/head/JournalHeadPreflight.scala  # JournalHead preflight CLI that calls DescribeTable through the v2 DynamoDbClient (#882).
